From 6ffc9c97f3d590c8928ab55a3a8a3de6016b4976 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Claude <noreply@anthropic.com>
Date: Wed, 10 Jun 2026 10:00:32 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] feat(core): expand markets, add Kelly Criterion, update UI
MIME-Version: 1.0
Content-Type: text/plain; charset=UTF-8
Content-Transfer-Encoding: 8bit

Backend
- markets.py: add Over/Under 1.5 and 4.5, full Asian Handicap ladder
  (home/away -0.5, -1, -1.5, +0.5), combined markets (BTTS+Over/Under 2.5,
  Result+Over 2.5) and Total Goals ranges (0-1, 2-3, 4+).
- odds.py: add Kelly Criterion fraction to ValueResult — full Kelly is
  returned, frontend can apply fractional sizing.
- schemas.py: refactor MarketsOut / FairOddsOut to share a _MarketFields
  base so adding a market only takes one edit per layer.
- routes/matches.py: surface kelly_pct + quarter_kelly_pct in the value
  response.

Frontend
- types/index.ts: MarketSet shared between Markets and FairOdds.
- MarketsGrid: render the new markets in dedicated sections.
- ValueFinder: dropdown covers the new markets; the result card now shows
  full-Kelly and 1/4-Kelly stake sizing whenever EV is positive.

All 41 backend tests still pass.
